+Wasmer detects Next.js and builds the app with `npm run build`. Its button
+builds this public repository as-is and does not fork it; to customize the site
+(`src/config.ts`, `src/shared/data`, `src/content`) and redeploy on push, fork
+the repository and connect the fork from the Wasmer dashboard. On Wasmer,
